<title>USA: Dollar Tree sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Dollar Tree sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollar Tree Stores Inc said on Wednesday that its board has approved a 3-for-2 stock split, for shareholders of record as of the close of business on July 14, 1997.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed on or about July 21, the retailer said in a statement.</p>
